    {
      "speakerId": "251691464061534419856",
      "topic": "Discussion",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "start": 41050,
          "end": 47050,
          "text": "Honestly it's more about consistency and actually having a record we can look back on."
        },
        {
          "start": 47200,
          "end": 54800,
          "text": "If it also saves managers time that's a nice bonus, but it's not the main thing I'd pitch internally."
